## 2. Tech Stack Mapping

| Layer | Technology | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| UI / Presentation | **SwiftUI** | Declarative native UI for iOS/iPadOS |
| Business Logic | **Swift ViewModels** | Form validation, state holding, SDK orchestration |
| Navigation | **NavigationStack** | Hierarchical routing within the app |
| Data Models | **Swift Structs** | Strongly-typed Codable data structures |
| Backend Services | **Supabase Swift SDK** | Direct DB queries, Auth session management |
| Secure Logic | **Supabase Edge Functions** | Order creation, payment verification, webhooks |
| Payments | **Razorpay iOS SDK** | Native payment sheet presentation |
| Dependency Mgt | **Swift Package Manager**| Managing SDK versions |

